<title>USA: Research Inc sees gain from property sale.</title>
<headline>Research Inc sees gain from property sale.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research Inc, which earlier reported lower fourth-quarter earnings, said Tuesday it expects a gain of about $0.60 a share in the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said the after-tax gain is the result of the sale of undeveloped land.</p>
<p>Research Inc earlier reported its earnings dropped to $103,137, or $0.09 a share, for the fourth quarter ended September 30 from $237,917, or $0.21 a share, a year ago.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
